      "contextBefore": "```swift\nvar includesPastActivity: Bool { get }\n```",
      "contextAfter": "For example, if your app calls [`startMonitoring(_:during:events:)`](deviceactivitycenter/startmonitoring(_:during:events:).md) at 1:30pm with a schedule of 1:00pm to 2:00pm, then this boolean determines whether any activity between 1:00pm and 1:30pm will contribute to its threshold.",
