    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0008",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "For example, if your app calls [`startMonitoring(_:during:events:)`](deviceactivitycenter/startmonitoring(_:during:events:).md) at 1:30pm with a schedule of 1:00pm to 2:00pm, then this boolean determines whether any activity between 1:00pm and 1:30pm will contribute to its threshold.",
      "normalizedSource": "For example, if your app calls [`startMonitoring(_:during:events:)`](deviceactivitycenter/startmonitoring(_:during:events:).md) at 1:30pm with a schedule of 1:00pm to 2:00pm, then this boolean determines whether any activity between 1:00pm and 1:30pm will contribute to its threshold.",
      "sourceHash": "4b9b6c946668600a2f923b63c66d7d63c023fe20e6549fc4c87369dd9962a360",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Discussion",
      "contextAfter": "If set to `true` and the event’s schedule does not start on a round hour (for example, it starts at 1:15pm instead of 1:00pm), the system will include device activity from the start of the nearest round hour (for example, it will still include usage from 1:00pm to 1:15pm).",
